{"id": "33933", "title": "我的暴君(变身游戏顾问公司6)", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 58, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33933.htm", "intro": "唉，毕业即失业已够教人苦恼，她还得和个暴君同住一屋檐下，尊称那人前优雅贵公子一枚，人后把她压在地上欺负的野蛮男大少爷，她这下人女可一点都不想飞高高当凤凰女，认认真真找工作去才是真的！偏她“变身淑女”好求得心情佳、头路顺，身穿洋装手却拎高跟鞋的糗状被他瞧了去，就连小少爷喝失恋酒她这陪客先醉了，都是他送人送上床，还“体贴”的帮忙脱衣脱到只剩小衣裤，天啊，干扁扁的身子不就被他看光光？这男人还在一场晚宴上硬拉她当女伴，趁她喝得醉晕晕到房间玩起一种游戏……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33933", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2157490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2157491.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2157492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2157493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2157494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2157495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2157496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2157497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2157498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2157499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2157500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2157501.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2157502.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2157503.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2157504.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2157505.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2157506.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2157507.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2157508.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2157509.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2157510.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2157511.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2157512.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2157513.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file":